Hi all,
I am installing the AR9380 NIC on laptops, but some only have two UFL connectors, and thus I was wondering if using only two of the UFL antenna ports will have any negative effect or difference than installing a 2x2 NIC (AR9280 for example which has only 2 ports anyway). Please kindly explain (with references if possible).
Also for example is there anyway to disable transmission on the third UFL port (antenna) from ath9k or otherwise.
